{
  "version": 4,
  "name": "A Canvas drawn through a material. Its layer goes into a picture of its own, and the material lays that picture a quarter of the screen to the right: the red square and the half-clear white one land there and leave the world showing where they were authored, the white still half the world behind it, and a square that only adds light adds it to the world without hiding any. The Canvas on another layer has no material and stays where it was put.",
